  "duration_s": 291.152993,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "今天晚上李总组了个局陈，总也会过去。琳琳小张，你俩跟我一起去。好的，王姐没问题。王姐，对了，今晚来的都是重要客户，说话做事都注意点，放心吧，王姐，我肯定不给您丢人哟。王姐来了，快坐快坐。不好意思，让两位久等了，哪里哪里都是自己人。小张啊，今天高兴，刚好李总和陈总都在你来讲两句，那祝大家吃好喝。好，我先干了王姐，那我也借这个机会说两句。好，你说非常感谢李总今天组的局，也感谢王姐带我们过来，让我们有幸认识各位前辈，我叫琳琳。俗话说，相聚是一种缘分。此时此刻，我把对各位的祝福化作一杯美酒，祝各位扶摇直上。九万里事业长虹节节高。好，这姑娘聪明，王姐来这杯，我敬你。哎，陈总这杯我替王姐敬您，我敬的是你们领导，你是领导吗？瞧您说的，您敬的是我领导，我同样敬的也是领导，您敬领导是心意，我敬您是尊敬这杯，我敬的是生意，咱们随意，祝您生意一路昌宏，万事顺利。哈哈哈，这小姑娘会说话。琳琳刚才说的不错，来咱俩喝一个，谢谢李总。哎，怎么到我这儿就剩半杯了。李总瓶底酒，这叫发财酒，到底发财好事再来哈哈哈哈哈，好一个发财酒。琳玲，我再问你个问题，你觉得我和李总你更喜欢谁？领导怎么能用喜欢呢？那得是尊敬两位领导，我都尊敬这姑娘聪明琳琳，这条鱼没怎么动，都是自己人，别嫌弃，一会儿打包带回去，吃吧，还能补身子。琳琳陈总让你拿，你就拿着呗，太感谢陈总了，但是一整条鱼我自己也吃不完。我平时喜欢吃鱼尾上面这部分，我给您打包带回去给嫂子也尝一下，以后还希望您多多照顾，看来今天这条鱼没白点。玲琳，陈总那边刚刚来消息，昨天谈的那个项目确定跟咱们合作了，而且陈总还特意提了一句，后面让你负责对接，谢谢王姐，我一定把它做好。琳琳，我现在是真服你了，怎么了？你想想啊。那天陈总说，我敬的是你们领导，你是领导吗？换成我，我当场就不知道该说什么了。饭局上突然让你讲话，给李总倒酒，只剩半杯。陈总问你，他和李总你更喜欢谁？还有最后那条鱼，我到现在才明白，陈总说的根本就不只是鱼，是你到底是怎么练的？为什么别人突然给你一句话，你马上就知道该怎么接。其实我以前跟你一样不爱说话，也不知道怎么组织语言，一到这种场合就不知道应该说什么。后来我就经常看这本把话说的恰到好处。它里面就是一个场景，一个场景的告诉你，遇到不同的人不同的话应该怎么接。比如别人夸你优秀，你可以回，那是不优秀点儿，怎么能和你做朋友呢？当别人说你真聪明，你就回近朱者赤，和你在一起啊，熏都熏出来了当领导跟你说辛苦了，你就回领导，这都是我应该做的。强将手下吴若兵，我怎么能给您丢脸呢？难怪你每次都能接的这么快。这种东西不是天生的，就是平时一个场景，一个场景的看一个场景，一个场景的练，每天看两页，慢慢积累一些不同的场景之下，应该怎么说？这里面还有很多生活里的场景，比如对象给你发红包，你可以回你是我致富道路上最大的功臣。同事向你借钱，你又不想借，可以回，大家都是一样的年纪，你没有的，我能有吗？还有心仪的人跟你说我想你了，你可以回随便想，千万别跟我客气，目前不收费。这个有意思。我第一次读到这些的时候，真的有种豁然开朗的感觉。这本书就是把工作、生活、人际交往里经常遇到的场景，一个一个拆开给你看，别人怎么说，你可以怎么接，都是一句一句给你举例。所以你平时就是这么练的对呀，每天不用看很多看两页，碰到自己觉得有用的表达就记一记慢慢积累的多了。工作和生活里再碰到类似的场景，你就知道怎么接了。这本先借我看看，拿去吧，回去慢慢看。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00001",
      "start_ms": 210,
      "end_ms": 2190,
      "text": "今天晚上李总组了个局陈，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00002",
      "start_ms": 2190,
      "end_ms": 3090,
      "text": "总也会过去。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00003",
      "start_ms": 3390,
      "end_ms": 4110,
      "text": "琳琳小张，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00004",
      "start_ms": 4230,
      "end_ms": 5110,
      "text": "你俩跟我一起去。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00005",
      "start_ms": 5270,
      "end_ms": 5590,
      "text": "好的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00006",
      "start_ms": 5590,
      "end_ms": 6630,
      "text": "王姐没问题。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00007",
      "start_ms": 6630,
      "end_ms": 7030,
      "text": "王姐，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00008",
      "start_ms": 8010,
      "end_ms": 8470,
      "text": "对了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00009",
      "start_ms": 8950,
      "end_ms": 10430,
      "text": "今晚来的都是重要客户，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00010",
      "start_ms": 10930,
      "end_ms": 12290,
      "text": "说话做事都注意点，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00011",
      "start_ms": 12730,
      "end_ms": 13190,
      "text": "放心吧，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00012",
      "start_ms": 13190,
      "end_ms": 13530,
      "text": "王姐，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00013",
      "start_ms": 13770,
      "end_ms": 18690,
      "text": "我肯定不给您丢人哟。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00014",
      "start_ms": 19130,
      "end_ms": 19970,
      "text": "王姐来了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00015",
      "start_ms": 20170,
      "end_ms": 20970,
      "text": "快坐快坐。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00016",
      "start_ms": 21490,
      "end_ms": 22290,
      "text": "不好意思，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00017",
      "start_ms": 22590,
      "end_ms": 23710,
      "text": "让两位久等了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00018",
      "start_ms": 23950,
      "end_ms": 26055,
      "text": "哪里哪里都是自己人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00019",
      "start_ms": 28960,
      "end_ms": 29540,
      "text": "小张啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00020",
      "start_ms": 29940,
      "end_ms": 30680,
      "text": "今天高兴，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00021",
      "start_ms": 30860,
      "end_ms": 33280,
      "text": "刚好李总和陈总都在你来讲两句，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00022",
      "start_ms": 34680,
      "end_ms": 36020,
      "text": "那祝大家吃好喝。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00023",
      "start_ms": 36020,
      "end_ms": 36260,
      "text": "好，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00024",
      "start_ms": 36340,
      "end_ms": 47840,
      "text": "我先干了王姐，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00025",
      "start_ms": 48180,
      "end_ms": 49800,
      "text": "那我也借这个机会说两句。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00026",
      "start_ms": 50020,
      "end_ms": 50260,
      "text": "好，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00027",
      "start_ms": 50720,
      "end_ms": 53020,
      "text": "你说非常感谢李总今天组的局，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00028",
      "start_ms": 53080,
      "end_ms": 54440,
      "text": "也感谢王姐带我们过来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00029",
      "start_ms": 54440,
      "end_ms": 55820,
      "text": "让我们有幸认识各位前辈，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00030",
      "start_ms": 56080,
      "end_ms": 56760,
      "text": "我叫琳琳。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00031",
      "start_ms": 57020,
      "end_ms": 57600,
      "text": "俗话说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00032",
      "start_ms": 57680,
      "end_ms": 58800,
      "text": "相聚是一种缘分。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00033",
      "start_ms": 59020,
      "end_ms": 59875,
      "text": "此时此刻，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00034",
      "start_ms": 60170,
      "end_ms": 62230,
      "text": "我把对各位的祝福化作一杯美酒，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00035",
      "start_ms": 62490,
      "end_ms": 63670,
      "text": "祝各位扶摇直上。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00036",
      "start_ms": 63670,
      "end_ms": 65730,
      "text": "九万里事业长虹节节高。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00037",
      "start_ms": 66770,
      "end_ms": 67235,
      "text": "好，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00038",
      "start_ms": 67640,
      "end_ms": 68965,
      "text": "这姑娘聪明，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00039",
      "start_ms": 70580,
      "end_ms": 72100,
      "text": "王姐来这杯，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00040",
      "start_ms": 72100,
      "end_ms": 72585,
      "text": "我敬你。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00041",
      "start_ms": 72990,
      "end_ms": 73205,
      "text": "哎，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00042",
      "start_ms": 73970,
      "end_ms": 75610,
      "text": "陈总这杯我替王姐敬您，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00043",
      "start_ms": 75830,
      "end_ms": 77030,
      "text": "我敬的是你们领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00044",
      "start_ms": 77090,
      "end_ms": 77935,
      "text": "你是领导吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00045",
      "start_ms": 83570,
      "end_ms": 84385,
      "text": "瞧您说的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00046",
      "start_ms": 84670,
      "end_ms": 85750,
      "text": "您敬的是我领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00047",
      "start_ms": 85950,
      "end_ms": 87385,
      "text": "我同样敬的也是领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00048",
      "start_ms": 87590,
      "end_ms": 88690,
      "text": "您敬领导是心意，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00049",
      "start_ms": 88730,
      "end_ms": 90530,
      "text": "我敬您是尊敬这杯，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00050",
      "start_ms": 90650,
      "end_ms": 91755,
      "text": "我敬的是生意，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00051",
      "start_ms": 92150,
      "end_ms": 92930,
      "text": "咱们随意，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00052",
      "start_ms": 93090,
      "end_ms": 94390,
      "text": "祝您生意一路昌宏，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00053",
      "start_ms": 94510,
      "end_ms": 95355,
      "text": "万事顺利。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00054",
      "start_ms": 96510,
      "end_ms": 96995,
      "text": "哈哈哈，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00055",
      "start_ms": 97270,
      "end_ms": 98430,
      "text": "这小姑娘会说话。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00056",
      "start_ms": 98490,
      "end_ms": 100080,
      "text": "琳琳刚才说的不错，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00057",
      "start_ms": 100140,
      "end_ms": 101120,
      "text": "来咱俩喝一个，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00058",
      "start_ms": 101120,
      "end_ms": 101745,
      "text": "谢谢李总。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00059",
      "start_ms": 104380,
      "end_ms": 104705,
      "text": "哎，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00060",
      "start_ms": 105020,
      "end_ms": 106500,
      "text": "怎么到我这儿就剩半杯了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00061",
      "start_ms": 106680,
      "end_ms": 108120,
      "text": "李总瓶底酒，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00062",
      "start_ms": 108140,
      "end_ms": 109000,
      "text": "这叫发财酒，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00063",
      "start_ms": 109140,
      "end_ms": 112005,
      "text": "到底发财好事再来哈哈哈哈哈，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00064",
      "start_ms": 112290,
      "end_ms": 113595,
      "text": "好一个发财酒。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00065",
      "start_ms": 114600,
      "end_ms": 115055,
      "text": "琳玲，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00066",
      "start_ms": 115720,
      "end_ms": 116665,
      "text": "我再问你个问题，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00067",
      "start_ms": 117130,
      "end_ms": 119205,
      "text": "你觉得我和李总你更喜欢谁？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00068",
      "start_ms": 120760,
      "end_ms": 122280,
      "text": "领导怎么能用喜欢呢？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00069",
      "start_ms": 122460,
      "end_ms": 124300,
      "text": "那得是尊敬两位领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00070",
      "start_ms": 124300,
      "end_ms": 131000,
      "text": "我都尊敬这姑娘聪明琳琳，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00071",
      "start_ms": 131420,
      "end_ms": 132620,
      "text": "这条鱼没怎么动，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00072",
      "start_ms": 132920,
      "end_ms": 133740,
      "text": "都是自己人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00073",
      "start_ms": 133780,
      "end_ms": 134400,
      "text": "别嫌弃，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00074",
      "start_ms": 134700,
      "end_ms": 135580,
      "text": "一会儿打包带回去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00075",
      "start_ms": 135580,
      "end_ms": 136000,
      "text": "吃吧，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00076",
      "start_ms": 136000,
      "end_ms": 136840,
      "text": "还能补身子。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00077",
      "start_ms": 137120,
      "end_ms": 138560,
      "text": "琳琳陈总让你拿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00078",
      "start_ms": 138560,
      "end_ms": 139455,
      "text": "你就拿着呗，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00079",
      "start_ms": 142020,
      "end_ms": 143100,
      "text": "太感谢陈总了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00080",
      "start_ms": 143320,
      "end_ms": 145320,
      "text": "但是一整条鱼我自己也吃不完。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00081",
      "start_ms": 145540,
      "end_ms": 147640,
      "text": "我平时喜欢吃鱼尾上面这部分，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00082",
      "start_ms": 147640,
      "end_ms": 149600,
      "text": "我给您打包带回去给嫂子也尝一下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00083",
      "start_ms": 149640,
      "end_ms": 151140,
      "text": "以后还希望您多多照顾，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00084",
      "start_ms": 154440,
      "end_ms": 156685,
      "text": "看来今天这条鱼没白点。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00085",
      "start_ms": 158800,
      "end_ms": 159220,
      "text": "玲琳，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00086",
      "start_ms": 159940,
      "end_ms": 161500,
      "text": "陈总那边刚刚来消息，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00087",
      "start_ms": 161500,
      "end_ms": 164340,
      "text": "昨天谈的那个项目确定跟咱们合作了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00088",
      "start_ms": 164560,
      "end_ms": 166060,
      "text": "而且陈总还特意提了一句，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00089",
      "start_ms": 166220,
      "end_ms": 167360,
      "text": "后面让你负责对接，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00090",
      "start_ms": 167740,
      "end_ms": 168440,
      "text": "谢谢王姐，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00091",
      "start_ms": 168460,
      "end_ms": 169485,
      "text": "我一定把它做好。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00092",
      "start_ms": 171490,
      "end_ms": 171930,
      "text": "琳琳，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00093",
      "start_ms": 172650,
      "end_ms": 173950,
      "text": "我现在是真服你了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00094",
      "start_ms": 174190,
      "end_ms": 174690,
      "text": "怎么了？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00095",
      "start_ms": 175390,
      "end_ms": 176230,
      "text": "你想想啊。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00096",
      "start_ms": 176470,
      "end_ms": 177550,
      "text": "那天陈总说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00097",
      "start_ms": 177710,
      "end_ms": 178850,
      "text": "我敬的是你们领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00098",
      "start_ms": 178850,
      "end_ms": 179690,
      "text": "你是领导吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00099",
      "start_ms": 179790,
      "end_ms": 180290,
      "text": "换成我，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00100",
      "start_ms": 180290,
      "end_ms": 181850,
      "text": "我当场就不知道该说什么了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00101",
      "start_ms": 181850,
      "end_ms": 183150,
      "text": "饭局上突然让你讲话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00102",
      "start_ms": 183290,
      "end_ms": 183930,
      "text": "给李总倒酒，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00103",
      "start_ms": 183930,
      "end_ms": 184570,
      "text": "只剩半杯。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00104",
      "start_ms": 184710,
      "end_ms": 185310,
      "text": "陈总问你，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00105",
      "start_ms": 185310,
      "end_ms": 186755,
      "text": "他和李总你更喜欢谁？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00106",
      "start_ms": 187030,
      "end_ms": 187935,
      "text": "还有最后那条鱼，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00107",
      "start_ms": 188530,
      "end_ms": 189565,
      "text": "我到现在才明白，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00108",
      "start_ms": 189940,
      "end_ms": 191525,
      "text": "陈总说的根本就不只是鱼，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00109",
      "start_ms": 192190,
      "end_ms": 193985,
      "text": "是你到底是怎么练的？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00110",
      "start_ms": 194320,
      "end_ms": 195540,
      "text": "为什么别人突然给你一句话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00111",
      "start_ms": 195540,
      "end_ms": 196785,
      "text": "你马上就知道该怎么接。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00112",
      "start_ms": 197720,
      "end_ms": 200160,
      "text": "其实我以前跟你一样不爱说话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00113",
      "start_ms": 200300,
      "end_ms": 201700,
      "text": "也不知道怎么组织语言，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00114",
      "start_ms": 201860,
      "end_ms": 203875,
      "text": "一到这种场合就不知道应该说什么。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00115",
      "start_ms": 204400,
      "end_ms": 207735,
      "text": "后来我就经常看这本把话说的恰到好处。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00116",
      "start_ms": 208060,
      "end_ms": 209220,
      "text": "它里面就是一个场景，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00117",
      "start_ms": 209220,
      "end_ms": 210300,
      "text": "一个场景的告诉你，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00118",
      "start_ms": 210360,
      "end_ms": 212535,
      "text": "遇到不同的人不同的话应该怎么接。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00119",
      "start_ms": 212890,
      "end_ms": 214470,
      "text": "比如别人夸你优秀，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00120",
      "start_ms": 214530,
      "end_ms": 215130,
      "text": "你可以回，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00121",
      "start_ms": 215450,
      "end_ms": 216550,
      "text": "那是不优秀点儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00122",
      "start_ms": 216550,
      "end_ms": 217870,
      "text": "怎么能和你做朋友呢？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00123",
      "start_ms": 217970,
      "end_ms": 219290,
      "text": "当别人说你真聪明，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00124",
      "start_ms": 219290,
      "end_ms": 220830,
      "text": "你就回近朱者赤，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00125",
      "start_ms": 220949,
      "end_ms": 221910,
      "text": "和你在一起啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00126",
      "start_ms": 221930,
      "end_ms": 224605,
      "text": "熏都熏出来了当领导跟你说辛苦了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00127",
      "start_ms": 224800,
      "end_ms": 225860,
      "text": "你就回领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00128",
      "start_ms": 225960,
      "end_ms": 227240,
      "text": "这都是我应该做的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00129",
      "start_ms": 227280,
      "end_ms": 228480,
      "text": "强将手下吴若兵，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00130",
      "start_ms": 228580,
      "end_ms": 229960,
      "text": "我怎么能给您丢脸呢？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00131",
      "start_ms": 230040,
      "end_ms": 231560,
      "text": "难怪你每次都能接的这么快。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00132",
      "start_ms": 231880,
      "end_ms": 233355,
      "text": "这种东西不是天生的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00133",
      "start_ms": 233740,
      "end_ms": 234940,
      "text": "就是平时一个场景，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00134",
      "start_ms": 234940,
      "end_ms": 236180,
      "text": "一个场景的看一个场景，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00135",
      "start_ms": 236180,
      "end_ms": 236915,
      "text": "一个场景的练，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00136",
      "start_ms": 237290,
      "end_ms": 238150,
      "text": "每天看两页，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00137",
      "start_ms": 238310,
      "end_ms": 240170,
      "text": "慢慢积累一些不同的场景之下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00138",
      "start_ms": 240170,
      "end_ms": 240870,
      "text": "应该怎么说？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00139",
      "start_ms": 241130,
      "end_ms": 242975,
      "text": "这里面还有很多生活里的场景，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00140",
      "start_ms": 243360,
      "end_ms": 244600,
      "text": "比如对象给你发红包，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00141",
      "start_ms": 244660,
      "end_ms": 247705,
      "text": "你可以回你是我致富道路上最大的功臣。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00142",
      "start_ms": 248130,
      "end_ms": 249110,
      "text": "同事向你借钱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00143",
      "start_ms": 249310,
      "end_ms": 250170,
      "text": "你又不想借，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00144",
      "start_ms": 250270,
      "end_ms": 250750,
      "text": "可以回，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00145",
      "start_ms": 250970,
      "end_ms": 252195,
      "text": "大家都是一样的年纪，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00146",
      "start_ms": 252480,
      "end_ms": 253105,
      "text": "你没有的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00147",
      "start_ms": 253320,
      "end_ms": 254020,
      "text": "我能有吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00148",
      "start_ms": 254220,
      "end_ms": 256520,
      "text": "还有心仪的人跟你说我想你了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00149",
      "start_ms": 256520,
      "end_ms": 258060,
      "text": "你可以回随便想，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00150",
      "start_ms": 258180,
      "end_ms": 259300,
      "text": "千万别跟我客气，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00151",
      "start_ms": 259340,
      "end_ms": 260585,
      "text": "目前不收费。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00152",
      "start_ms": 261910,
      "end_ms": 262765,
      "text": "这个有意思。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00153",
      "start_ms": 263280,
      "end_ms": 264620,
      "text": "我第一次读到这些的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00154",
      "start_ms": 264620,
      "end_ms": 266405,
      "text": "真的有种豁然开朗的感觉。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00155",
      "start_ms": 266860,
      "end_ms": 270505,
      "text": "这本书就是把工作、生活、人际交往里经常遇到的场景，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00156",
      "start_ms": 270800,
      "end_ms": 272255,
      "text": "一个一个拆开给你看，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00157",
      "start_ms": 272660,
      "end_ms": 273380,
      "text": "别人怎么说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00158",
      "start_ms": 273500,
      "end_ms": 274300,
      "text": "你可以怎么接，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00159",
      "start_ms": 274480,
      "end_ms": 275965,
      "text": "都是一句一句给你举例。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00160",
      "start_ms": 276210,
      "end_ms": 278055,
      "text": "所以你平时就是这么练的对呀，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00161",
      "start_ms": 278440,
      "end_ms": 280160,
      "text": "每天不用看很多看两页，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00162",
      "start_ms": 280240,
      "end_ms": 283520,
      "text": "碰到自己觉得有用的表达就记一记慢慢积累的多了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00163",
      "start_ms": 283620,
      "end_ms": 285815,
      "text": "工作和生活里再碰到类似的场景，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00164",
      "start_ms": 285990,
      "end_ms": 287065,
      "text": "你就知道怎么接了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00165",
      "start_ms": 288310,
      "end_ms": 289315,
      "text": "这本先借我看看，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00166",
      "start_ms": 289660,
      "end_ms": 290220,
      "text": "拿去吧，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2ad33b07cfad615d_s00167",
      "start_ms": 290300,
      "end_ms": 291015,
      "text": "回去慢慢看。"
    }
  ],
